# Vercel Deployment Exclusions
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RULE: Only api/ and templates/ are needed at runtime.
#       Everything else is training research and must be excluded
#       to keep the serverless function bundle under 500 MB.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Raw datasets (never needed at runtime)
archive (2)/
archive (3)/
doi_10_6078_D1V67R__v20180717/
RDD Datset/
SupplementaryData/

# Entire ML research/training tree (heavy .joblib files, CSVs, notebooks)
# The runtime uses api/models_bundle.json — NOT these sklearn artifacts
aaci_ml/

# Testing & temporary caches
.pytest_cache/
catboost_info/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
*.tmp
*.log

# Non-runtime root files
*.pdf
DEPLOYMENT.md

